2104
01:21:17.580 --> 01:21:20.090
It was just process, process, process.

2105
01:21:20.090 --> 01:21:23.290
And I understood what Angus was saying at that moment.

2106
01:21:23.290 --> 01:21:25.010
Meanwhile, your in California.

