01:21:46.700 --> 01:21:51.700
very, very careful and a guy wrote a Vesper with Matt brown,

2119
01:21:51.950 --> 01:21:53.870
very intelligent guy on top of being

2120
01:21:53.870 --> 01:21:57.380
a great rower, rowed at Yale then rowed at Oxford.

2121
01:21:57.380 --> 01:21:59.757
So an intelligent guy, and by the way...

2122
01:21:59.757 --> 01:22:01.539
But also like a beast.

