01:22:25.500 --> 01:22:27.471
a trials boat, anyone can enter that.

2134
01:22:27.471 --> 01:22:29.162
Rich you could enter it next year

2135
01:22:29.162 --> 01:22:31.310
and go and try to do the open mic and,

