I mean, so as like, this is what I'm gonna do,

2147
01:22:54.120 --> 01:22:55.770
I'm gonna offer them this something else.

2148
01:22:55.770 --> 01:22:57.340
And that's what I did. I called him.

2149
01:22:57.340 --> 01:22:58.330
And as he said to me, he's like,

