01:22:58.330 --> 01:23:01.500
yeah, you didn't have to finish the sentence, I'm in.

2151
01:23:01.500 --> 01:23:03.570
And it wasn't an I'm in because I'm naive,

2152
01:23:03.570 --> 01:23:04.650
and I don't understand this stuff.

2153
01:23:04.650 --> 01:23:07.237
He had been me and my race the year before.

2154
01:23:07.237 --> 01:23:09.310
And this guy was no stranger to hard work

2155
01:23:09.310 --> 01:23:10.900
and no stranger to be an underdog.

2156
01:23:10.900 --> 01:23:15.050
I mean, he came from, from nothing,

2157
01:23:15.050 --> 01:23:16.880
and built himself up to having

2158
01:23:16.880 --> 01:23:20.410
a first rate education through working hard.

2159
01:23:20.410 --> 01:23:21.970
So that was our team.

2160
01:23:21.970 --> 01:23:23.190
And all of a sudden, now we've got a team.

2161
01:23:23.190 --> 01:23:25.670
Yeah and taking everything that you would learn

2162
01:23:25.670 --> 01:23:28.300
the year prior and these kinds of lessons about

2163
01:23:28.300 --> 01:23:31.476
teamwork and leadership and what went wrong before

2164
01:23:31.476 --> 01:23:33.220
and how to course correct that.

2165
01:23:33.220 --> 01:23:36.130
Like how do you then approach,

2166
01:23:36.130 --> 01:23:40.070
this group of guys as a leader to get their heads around

2167
01:23:40.070 --> 01:23:42.040
what you guys are going to try to tackle

2168
01:23:42.040 --> 01:23:45.320
also while you're all dispersed all over the place.

2169
01:23:45.320 --> 01:23:47.604
Yeah, that was the, that was the big like,

2170
01:23:47.604 --> 01:23:48.970
that was the big problem to solve for.

2171
01:23:48.970 --> 01:23:52.159
And we've got very little time and I just,

2172
01:23:52.159 --> 01:23:55.240
I'm always hearkened back to this idea

2173
