02:16:44.952 --> 02:16:47.570
you make them do something hard together

3498
02:16:47.570 --> 02:16:49.860
and have a sort of transformative experience

3499
02:16:49.860 --> 02:16:52.490
that congeals them and weds them to each other

3500
02:16:52.490 --> 02:16:55.430
in a way that, information on its own

3501
02:16:55.430 --> 02:16:57.950
just isn't going to accomplish.

3502
02:16:57.950 --> 02:16:59.440
Yep, that's what our company's

3503
02:16:59.440 --> 02:17:01.720
essentially been all about is that,

3504
02:17:01.720 --> 02:17:04.820
you hear the other competing companies is studies show this

3505
02:17:04.820 --> 02:17:07.380
about leadership and building teams and surveys show that.

