02:17:07.380 --> 02:17:09.780
But largely the people that are teaching this stuff

3507
02:17:09.780 --> 02:17:13.350
from my experience have stood on the sidelines of,

3508
02:17:13.350 --> 02:17:15.300
of building teams or even been part of teams

3509
02:17:15.300 --> 02:17:16.133
their whole life.

3510
02:17:16.133 --> 02:17:18.740
They've studied them. They've read the books

3511
